  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_F_BERSERK_WYALD_PRISONER_TRACE",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The cord was cut patiently, strand by strand. Muddy human footprints lead through the western cage door toward the quarry. There is no prisoner left to escort, only a route someone paid dearly to find.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_F_BERSERK_WYALD_RING_WARNING",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The leader's ground lies beyond the timber. Three wrecked barriers break the open earth, with space to sidestep and strike back. The quarry on the west remains a way out; crossing the inner clearing may bring Wyald into the fight.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_F_BERSERK_ROSINE_MISSING_TRACE",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The tracks enter a bright clearing and do not return. A searcher's bundle lies behind you. Ahead, the games give way to silk. The western gully is slower, but avoids the heart of the cocoon grove.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_F_BERSERK_ROSINE_STORY_COCOON",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "Someone marked this shell before cutting it open. The cloth inside is torn through the middle, not worn out. The searcher scratched: I was too late; I can only warn the next traveler. This shell cannot be used to reverse a transformation. Around the roots, other cocoons still swell.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_F_BERSERK_ROSINE_NEST_WARNING",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The great tree hides Rosine's nest. Its roots and stones interrupt a straight dive, but neither route is a sealed shelter. There are only a few winged sentries. Swelling cocoons can add more; destroy a shell before it opens or keep to the gully. Beyond the threshold, Rosine may join the battle.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
